    { title: "Revenue dashboard", body: "See carts captured, recovery rate, and dollars recovered — with per-sequence performance." },
    { title: "Your own SMTP", body: "Sends go through wp_mail, so your existing deliverability stack applies, with CAN-SPAM footer and one-click unsubscribe built in." },
